        <p class="mt-[1.3em] text-[20px] leading-[1.3] font-medium tracking-[-0.06em] text-[#6b6b6b] max-[950px]:text-[18px] max-[950px]:tracking-[-0.04em]">Sed ut perspiciatis unde omnis iste natus error. Sit voluptatem accusantium, doloremque.<br class="max-[950px]:hidden" />Laudantium totam rem. <span class="accent text-forest">Ipsum in <strong class="font-semibold">10 seconds</strong>.</span></p>
      </div>
      <Panel variant="plain" class="mb-[165px] max-[950px]:mb-[96px]">
