        <li class="text-[20px] leading-[1.1] font-medium tracking-[-0.06em] text-ink-2 max-[950px]:text-[17px] max-[950px]:leading-[1.25] max-[950px]:tracking-[-0.04em]">Lorem ipsum dolor sit? <span class="accent text-forest"><strong class="font-semibold">Consectetur adipiscing.</strong></span></li>
        <li class="text-[20px] leading-[1.1] font-medium tracking-[-0.06em] text-ink-2 max-[950px]:text-[17px] max-[950px]:leading-[1.25] max-[950px]:tracking-[-0.04em]">Sed do eiusmod tempor? <span class="accent text-forest"><strong class="font-semibold">Incididunt ut labore et dolore.</strong></span></li>
        <li class="text-[20px] leading-[1.1] font-medium tracking-[-0.06em] text-ink-2 max-[950px]:text-[17px] max-[950px]:leading-[1.25] max-[950px]:tracking-[-0.04em]">Magna aliqua enim? <span class="accent text-forest"><strong class="font-semibold">Ad-minim.</strong></span></li>
        <li class="text-[20px] leading-[1.1] font-medium tracking-[-0.06em] text-ink-2 max-[950px]:text-[17px] max-[950px]:leading-[1.25] max-[950px]:tracking-[-0.04em]">Veniam quis? <span class="accent text-forest"><strong class="font-semibold">Nostrud exercitation &lt;30 seconds.</strong></span></li>
        <li class="text-[20px] leading-[1.1] font-medium tracking-[-0.06em] text-ink-2 max-[950px]:text-[17px] max-[950px]:leading-[1.25] max-[950px]:tracking-[-0.04em]">Ullamco laboris nisi aliquip? <span class="accent text-forest"><strong class="font-semibold">Ex ea commodo consequat.</strong></span></li>
